sentences.text:
By the impugned order on sentence, the learned Trial Court sentenced the appellant as under:
a. to undergo rigorous imprisonment for a period of five years and to pay a fine of 10,000/- for the offence under Section 10 of the POCSO Act, and in default of payment of fine, to undergo simple imprisonment for a period of 1 month;
b. to undergo rigorous imprisonment for a period of three years and to pay a fine of 5,000/- for the offence under Section 354B of the IPC, and in default of payment of fine, to undergo simple imprisonment for a period of 1 month;
Santosh Yadav vs State (Nct Of Delhi) on 7 March, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/93399779/
